s identify several areas where we could make the experience smoother, clearer, and more enjoyable.Below is a list of functional and quality of l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T01:17:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530896220","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3876490-1832065502818330","game_id":"steam-3876490","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO RELEASE ON MAY 12th","summary":"IT’S FINALLY TIME. We are officially committing to releasing the No Wings Required demo on May 12th. Right now, we’re doing the final rounds of testing for the Mac build, so unless something new suddenly explodes (PLEASE don’t explode), there shouldn’t be any more delays. Okay, now for the explanation. Why did we disappear for a few months? The truth is we scope-crept this demo into oblivion. Originally, the plan for the demo was simple:1 small map1 fetch quest1 minigamemaybe a hidden treasureBu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-09T22:11:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502818330","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3876490-1823191198606971","game_id":"steam-3876490","kind":"announcement","title":"LOOK MOM, WE'RE LIVE!","summary":"Thank you so much for stopping by and taking a look at our page. It has been a huge journey for us to get to this point and we’re super excited to be able to share our game. If No Wings Required feels like a game for you, please consider adding it to your Wishlist to stay updated. It truly helps a lot and means the world to us. 🙂","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-31T06:30:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net